<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20589" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hēsĭŏdus</span></b> ,
		i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡσίοδος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the Greek poet Hesiod</i>, <i><span class="en">Gell. 3,
			11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">17, 21,
			3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vell. 1, 7, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 10,
				1, 52</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 11,
				19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 1, 14, 36</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Off.
				1, 15, 98</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Derivv. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hēsĭŏdēus</span></b>  or
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-īus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡσιόδειος</span>, <i>of</i> or <i>relating to Hesiod</i>, <i>Hesiodic</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illud Hesiodium laudatur a doctis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Brut. 4, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carmina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Carm. 9, 213</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hēsĭŏdĭcus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., the same: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carmen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Serv. Verg. G. 2, 176</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
